Date: 2026-08-02
Reviewed base: `61134af`
Scope: directory access enforcement, session/project UX, and shell confinement

## Outcome

All actionable findings from the review are addressed. The backend remains the source of truth, the frontend now explains every blocked selection, and `bash`/`bash_control` stay registered and usable under restricted access through an OS-level filesystem sandbox.

